# Editorial notes for the 429 Steam tags. Original text written for this project.
# Columns: tag | play (agon alea mimicry ilinx, each 0-3) | summary | representative works (" / " separated)
# Representative works are illustrative examples chosen by the editor, not Steam's official tag ranking.
# Mature-content tags intentionally list no works.
Indie|0000|独立系・小規模チームによる制作を示す販売上のタグ。ジャンルや遊び方は規定しない。|Hollow Knight / Stardew Valley / Undertale
Action|3001|反射・操作精度・瞬間の判断が中心となる遊び全般。|Devil May Cry 5 / DOOM Eternal / Hades
